# Git LFS configuration for large binary sound bank and containers
Sounds/SOUND.SP filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.sp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Windows CRLF line endings preserved for game text files
*.txt text eol=crlf
*.TXT text eol=crlf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
